\begin{note}
The \lstinline{@total_ordering} class decorator is applied to a class that has defined
\lstinline{__eq__} and one of the four comparison operators \lstinline{<}, \lstinline{<=}, \lstinline{>}, \lstinline{>=}.
It generates the other three comparison operators from those.
Like \lstinline{@dataclass}, it is a class decorator:
it takes a class, adds methods, and returns the (possibly modified) class.
\end{note}
